From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tymur Boiko <tboiko@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 11:21:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bug 2057577 - DOM Media - Add FFmpeg 63 support.
 r=alwu,frontend-codestyle-reviewers,Standard8

Raise FFMPEG_MAX_MAJOR_VERSION to 63 and add the ffmpeg63 header tree
so system/custom libavcodec.so.63 can be loaded. Keep libavcodec.so.62
in the runtime linker search list after the max bump. Adapt to FFmpeg
63 API removals: query sample rates via avcodec_get_supported_config,
and pick the Vulkan transfer queue from AVVulkanDeviceContext::qf.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314026
